atform iOS & Web sync",screenshot2Label:"Analytics - Understand your time allocation",screenshot3Label:"Quick Record - Log anywhere, anytime",screenshot4Label:"Smart Reminders - Effortless time management",featuresSectionTitle:"Simple yet Powerful Time Management",featuresSectionSubtitle:"ShiJi — Complete time tracking and analysis solution",feature1Title:"⚡ Lightning Fast, Done in 3 Seconds",feature1Desc:'Natural language parsing, no complex setup. Just type "8-9 meeting" and the system auto-detects time and tags. Supports voice input and quick commands, record effortlessly anywhere.',feature1List1:"Smart natural language parsing",feature1List2:"Voice quick input",feature1List3:"Auto tag recognition",clickToSwitch:"Click to switch",recordTrioTitle:"Record anywhere ✓",recordTrioApp:"Via App",recordTrioWechat:"Via WeChat service",recordTrioOCR:"Via OpenClaw",feature2TrioTitle:"Analysis types ✓",feature2Insight:"Time Insights",feature2Gap:"Gap Analysis",feature2Cycle:"Cycle Patterns",feature2Tag:"Tag Analysis",feature2Title:"📊 Deep Analysis, Time Insights",feature2Desc:"Multi-dimensional data visualization for clear time allocation insights. Daily/weekly/monthly/yearly reports, trend charts to discover time sinks and optimize efficiency.",feature2List1:"Multi-dimensional statistical charts",feature2List2:"Time trend analysis",feature2List3:"Tag category statistics",feature3Title:"🕐 Timeline Review, Life Records",feature3Desc:"Beautiful timeline view making every day memorable. Combined with photos and notes, build your personal life archive. Export and share to preserve precious moments.",feature3List1:"Visual timeline display",feature3List2:"Supports images and notes",feature3List3:"One-click export and share",feature4Title:"🤖 AI Assistant, Personalized Tips",feature4Desc:"Based on your time data, the AI assistant provides personalized suggestions. Auto-generate daily/weekly summaries, discover time patterns, build better time management habits.",feature4List1:"AI auto-generated summaries",feature4List2:"Smart time suggestions",feature4List3:"Habit formation reminders",highlightsSectionTitle:"Why Choose ShiJi?",highlight1Title:"Privacy First",highlight1Desc:"Encrypted data storage, completely yours. Local backup supported, never lost.",highlight2Title:"Cross-Platform Sync",highlight2Desc:"Seamless sync across iOS, Web, and desktop. Access your time data anywhere.",highlight3Title:"Clean & Beautiful",highlight3Desc:"Carefully designed interface with smooth interactions, making recording a pleasure.",highlight4Title:"Lightning Speed",highlight4Desc:"Millisecond response, 3 seconds to record, without interrupting your workflow.",highlight5Title:"Powerful Analytics",highlight5Desc:"Multi-dimensional data visualization to truly understand where your time goes.",highlight6Title:"Continuous Updates",highlight6Desc:"Actively listening to user feedback, monthly updates, constantly improving.",scenariosSectionTitle:"For Everyone Who Values Their Time",scenario1Title:"💼 Professionals",scenario1Desc:"Track work hours, analyze efficiency bottlenecks, optimize time allocation to increase output.",scenario2Title:"📚 Students",scenario2Desc:"Track study hours, schedule reviews scientifically, build good habits, and improve grades.",scenario3Title:"🎨 Freelancers",scenario3Desc:"Manage project time, client billing stats, improve discipline and achieve work-life balance.",scenario4Title:"⏰ Time Management Enthusiasts",scenario4Desc:"Quantify yourself, data-driven decisions, continuously optimize to become a better you.",testimonialsSectionTitle:"Real User Reviews",testimonial1Text:'"Used many time management tools — ShiJi is the most intuitive! Natural language input is so convenient, just a few seconds to log a full day. Analytics are powerful, helped me find many time wasters."',testimonial1Name:"Zhang Ming {'@'}Product Manager",testimonial1Role:"Using Timarkin for 6 months",testimonial2Text:'"As a student, Timarkin helped me develop a habit of 